#. ja: 追加納品する？
#. de: Zusätzliche Gegenstände abliefern?
#. fr: Remettre des produits sup<shy>plé<shy>men<shy>tai<shy>res<nbsp>?
msgctxt "leve/CraftLeveClient:TEXT_CRAFTLEVECLIENT_ADDITIONAL_TRADE_SELECTION_TITLE:1"
msgid "Submit additional items?"
msgstr "Сдать дополнительные предметы?"

#. ja: 追加納品する
#. de: Ja.
#. fr: Oui
msgctxt "leve/CraftLeveClient:TEXT_CRAFTLEVECLIENT_ADDITIONAL_TRADE_SELECTION_0:1"
msgid "Yes."
msgstr "Да."

#. ja: 任務終了にする
#. de: Nein, nur diese Lieferung übergeben.
#. fr: Non (mettre fin à la commande en cours)
msgctxt "leve/CraftLeveClient:TEXT_CRAFTLEVECLIENT_ADDITIONAL_TRADE_SELECTION_1:1"
msgid "No, complete the current order."
msgstr "Нет, завершить текущий заказ."

#. ja: あとで決める
#. de: Später entscheiden.
#. fr: Décider plus tard
msgctxt "leve/CraftLeveClient:TEXT_CRAFTLEVECLIENT_ADDITIONAL_TRADE_SELECTION_2:1"
msgid "Decide later."
msgstr "Решить позже."

#. ja: 納品アイテムが足りません。
#. de: Du hast nicht genügend der geforderten Gegenstände.
#. fr: L'objet demandé n'a pas été fourni ou la livraison est insuffisante en nombre.
msgctxt "leve/CraftLeveClient:TEXT_CRAFTLEVECLIENT_SYSTEM_NO_ITEM:1"
msgid "You do not have enough items."
msgstr "У вас недостаточно предметов."

#. ja: 追加納品を行わず、任務を終了します。<br>本当によろしいですか？
#. de: Beenden, ohne zusätzliche Gegenstände abzuliefern?
#. fr: Voulez-vous terminer la livraison sans remettre de produits sup<shy>plé<shy>men<shy>tai<shy>res<nbsp>?
msgctxt "leve/CraftLeveClient:TEXT_CRAFTLEVECLIENT_CONFIRM_CANCEL_ADDITIONAL_TRADE_TITLE:1"
msgid "Complete the current order without submitting additional items?"
msgstr "Завершить текущий заказ, не сдавая дополнительных предметов?<br>Вы уверены?"

#. ja: はい
#. de: Ja
#. fr: Oui
msgctxt "leve/CraftLeveClient:TEXT_CRAFTLEVECLIENT_CONFIRM_CANCEL_ADDITIONAL_TRADE_YES:1"
msgid "Yes"
msgstr "Да"

#. ja: いいえ
#. de: Nein
#. fr: Non
msgctxt "leve/CraftLeveClient:TEXT_CRAFTLEVECLIENT_CONFIRM_CANCEL_ADDITIONAL_TRADE_NO:1"
msgid "No"
msgstr "Нет"

#. ja: HQアイテムを<if ($n1 == 1)><else><num $n1>種類</if>納品したためボーナスがつき、<br>報酬が<num $n2>％追加されます。
#. de: Du hast <num $n1> <if ($n1 == 1)>Art<else>Arten</if> von HQ-Gegenständen abgegeben und bekommst dafür einen Bonus von <num $n2> % auf die Vergütung.
#. fr: La livraison comprend <if ($n1 == 1)>un objet<else><num $n1> types d'objets</if> de haute qualité. <br>Un bonus de <num $n2>% est ajouté à la récompense.
#. macro: <if ($n1 == 1)>one or more HQ items<else><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<ca… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 == 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1><… — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if> — shows the first branch when the condition holds, otherwise the branch after <else>; condition = number parameter 1 <= 10 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch> — shows the case whose position equals the value: the first <case> for 1, the second for 2, …; value = number parameter 1 (condition: may be reworded, restructured, added, or dropped)
#. macro: <num $n1> — a number; value = number parameter 1 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
#. macro: <num $n2> — a number; value = number parameter 2 (game data: keep it; it may move or repeat)
msgctxt "leve/CraftLeveClient:TEXT_CRAFTLEVECLIENT_TALK_ADD_REWARD:1"
msgid "The delivery included <if ($n1 == 1)>one or more HQ items<else><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>one<case>two<case>three<case>four<case>five<case>six<case>seven<case>eight<case>nine<case>ten</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if> types of HQ items</if>. Your reward has been increased by <num $n2>%."
msgstr "В поставке <if ($n1 == 1)>один или несколько предметов высокого качества<else><if $n1><if ($n1 <= 10)><switch $n1><case>один<case>два<case>три<case>четыре<case>пять<case>шесть<case>семь<case>восемь<case>девять<case>десять</switch><else><num $n1></if><else><num $n1></if> видов предметов высокого качества</if>. Награда увеличена на <num $n2>%."
